<article class="env-definition" id="07U1">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07U1">Definition <span data-tag="07U1">67.15.4</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a finite type quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module. The <em>scheme theoretic support of $\mathcal{F}$</em> is the closed subspace $Z \subset X$ constructed in Lemma <a href="/tag/07U0" data-tag="07U0">67.15.3</a>. </p>
